<section class="connection" data-tool-account-access aria-label="Agent connections">
  <div class="connection-heading"><h3>Connect your agent</h3><button type="button" data-access-refresh>Refresh</button></div>
  <p data-access-status role="status">Checking skill access…</p>
  <form data-access-create hidden>
    <label for="connection-label">Connection name</label><div class="connection-heading"><input id="connection-label" name="label" required maxlength="60" placeholder="My agent" autocomplete="off" /><button type="submit">Create connection</button></div>
  </form>
  <div data-access-secret hidden>
    <p>This credential is shown once. Keep it private; it is not an upstream provider key.</p>
    <label for="connection-secret">Private connection key</label><input id="connection-secret" type="password" readonly data-key-secret autocomplete="off" />
    <div class="connection-actions"><button type="button" data-key-reveal>Show</button><button type="button" data-key-copy>Copy key</button><button type="button" data-key-download>Download connection file</button><button type="button" data-key-check>Check connection</button></div>
    <p data-key-status role="status"></p>
    <p>Store the connection file in your agent’s secure environment. The free check verifies access without running research.</p>
  </div>
  <ul data-access-keys></ul>
  <a href="/billing/">Billing and task history →</a>
</section>
<style>
.connection{margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-line);padding-top:22px;font-size:14px}.connection-heading{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.connection h3{font-weight:600}.connection p{color:var(--color-soft);line-height:1.6;margin:12px 0}.connection label{display:block;margin:16px 0 6px}.connection input{width:100%;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--color-line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:var(--color-paper)}.connection button{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--color-line);border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.connection button:disabled{opacity:.5}.connection-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}.connection a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;display:inline-block;margin-top:14px}.connection :global(li){display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:12px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line)}.connection :global(small){display:block;color:var(--color-faint);margin-top:4px}[hidden]{display:none!important}
</style>
